    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Imposing architecturally designed family residence standing on C.0.49 Hectares/C.1.2 Acres of lawns superbly located on the outskirts of Cavan Town with an array of special features throughout. This property was designed to capture natural light and give a sense of space and enjoyable everyday surroundings. It comes to the market in pristine condition and boasts 4 en-suite bedrooms, 2 reception rooms, gallery and added bonus of a functional lift which services 3 floors. This property offers a unique opportunity to those in search of magnificent family residence situated on the outskirts of Cavan Town.\r\nAccessibility to the N3 is most convenient with Dublin or Belfast just over 1 hour drive"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor:\r\nHall 6.4m x 5.2m – Tiled floor\r\nOpen plan Sitting room/Lounge 12.6m x 8.5m with marble fireplace and feature high ceiling and windows\r\nKitchen/Dining room 7.5 x 5.1m – Fully fitted complete with island\r\nUtility 3.8m x 3.0m Fully fitted\r\nStudy 6.8m x 5.1m \r\nWC & WHB 2.6m x 1.3m Fuly tiled\r\nFirst floor is approached via oak staircase to spacious landing and gallery 7.5m x 3.5m\r\nMaster Bedroom 10.5m x 3.5m plus en-suite full bathroom 3.4m x 3.0m and walk in wardrobe 4.2m x 2.7m Laundry chute to utility room\r\nBedroom (2) 4.8m x 4.0m plus ensuite bathroom 2.6m x 1.9m Fully Tiled\r\nBedroom (3) 4.1m x 4.0m plus en-suite 2.0m x .6m Fully Tiled\r\nBedroom (4) 4.0m x 3.7m plus en-suite 2.6m x 1.7m Fully Tiled and built in wardrobe\r\n\r\nTotal Floor area: 380.76 sq.mtrs.\r\n\r\nLower Ground floor is accessed via stairway to garage 6.3m x 5.3m which is designed with a 2 door system (in and out)\r\nLift access from garage to each floor\r\nDetached outbuilding suitable for office use"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Solid oak doors, stairs and architrave throughout\r\nInternal Hoover system\r\nCast iron style radiators on ground floor\r\nWired for generator in event of power outage\r\nElectrical gated entrance and stone piers and walls\r\nPatio area with feature pond\r\nAbundance of natural light\r\nMature hedging on boundaries\r\nO.F.C.H. throughout\r\nLow maintenance exterior"
      },
      {
